LIBRARY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM PROJECT DOCUMENTATION

1. Project Title

LibraFlow – AI-Powered Library Management System


---

2. Introduction

LibraFlow is a modern web-based Library Management System that simplifies the management of library resources using Artificial Intelligence.
The application allows students and librarians to efficiently manage books, search the library catalog, and receive AI-powered assistance.
The system integrates Google Gemini AI to provide intelligent features such as semantic search, personalized recommendations, content summarization, and an AI assistant.


---

3. Problem Statement

Traditional library management systems often rely on manual processes and keyword-based searches, making it difficult for users
to quickly find relevant books or receive personalized assistance.

LibraFlow addresses these challenges by:

Automating library operations.

Improving book discovery with AI-powered semantic search.

Providing an intelligent assistant for user support.

Enhancing the user experience through personalized recommendations.



---

